WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.110
Edit account and profile details in Settings.

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:10.868
Review your username and photo and add only information you
want to share.

00:00:10.868 --> 00:00:12.511
Save your changes.

00:00:12.511 --> 00:00:20.000
If you have trouble signing in, use the Help Centre or Contact
to request support.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.104
Tags bring members together around shared topics.

00:00:25.104 --> 00:00:29.375
Search for an interest and open its page.

00:00:29.375 --> 00:00:35.833
Explore related posts and add relevant topics to your profile.

00:00:35.833 --> 00:00:40.000
You can update your interests over time.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.300
Read the event's date, location and attendance conditions,
then use Join.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:52.800
Approval-based events require the organiser's response.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:01:00.000
For invitation-only events, check your invitation and access
conditions.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.690
Privacy and notification preferences are in Settings.

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:10.796
Review what appears on your profile and which notifications
you want.

00:01:10.796 --> 00:01:16.460
Freezing an account and deleting its data are different
actions.

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:20.000
Use Data deletion for deletion requests.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:28.351
Konnektora offers event and place management tools for
organisers and businesses.

00:01:28.351 --> 00:01:31.340
Explore them on For business.

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.052
Account type and permissions matter.

00:01:35.052 --> 00:01:40.000
Some features depend on plan and device support.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:45.328
Search questions and read community rules in the Help Centre.

00:01:45.328 --> 00:01:50.218
Report problematic content through its reporting option.

00:01:50.218 --> 00:01:53.275
Use Contact for additional support.

00:01:53.275 --> 00:02:00.000
Do not include passwords, payment keys or identity documents
in your message.
